WEBVTT

00:00:00.406 --> 00:00:02.317
The Kei Kurono I remember.

00:00:02.341 --> 00:00:05.254
A running, shining, shouting friend.

00:00:05.278 --> 00:00:08.757
But now his friend is being ravaged
by strange, ferocious claws.

00:00:08.781 --> 00:00:10.159
What will the others do?

00:00:10.183 --> 00:00:11.927
What will he do?

00:00:11.951 --> 00:00:14.079
Next time: "Kei, You're Awesomel!”

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:38.821
Now listen, yo!

00:00:38.845 --> 00:00:39.922
People put your guns up

00:00:39.946 --> 00:00:41.590
First 'I run dat

00:00:41.614 --> 00:00:44.259
Run around and shoot them

00:00:44.283 --> 00:00:46.829
Brand new sound, yes still survival

00:00:46.853 --> 00:00:49.198
Here comes the sound boy, live in this world

00:00:49.222 --> 00:00:51.800
Intelligence, strength, and luck are swirling, flow

00:00:51.824 --> 00:00:54.736
My swelled mind is candid

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:55.771
One punch to Banner in Savannah

00:00:55.795 --> 00:00:57.072
An easy knockout, bam bam bam

00:00:57.096 --> 00:00:59.007
One time for your mind, live through this

00:00:59.031 --> 00:01:00.242
Around the world

00:01:00.266 --> 00:01:02.744
It haunts me, the pain of the past

00:01:02.768 --> 00:01:05.547
Around the noble god are borrowed things

00:01:05.571 --> 00:01:08.250
When the seed that's sown flowers, whose is it

00:01:08.274 --> 00:01:11.186
Live and fire the arrow of faith, more more more

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:13.722
There is no peace where you're going

00:01:13.746 --> 00:01:16.325
Come on, stand up, don't give up the fight

00:01:16.349 --> 00:01:21.430
Now, yes, this instant, die die die

00:01:21.454 --> 00:01:24.099
Big shooter, living fast, blazing

00:01:24.123 --> 00:01:26.702
Beat you up, cut it open, break

00:01:26.726 --> 00:01:29.338
Shot shooter, he lived fast, crazy

00:01:29.362 --> 00:01:32.040
Adjust your sights at point-blank range, break

00:01:32.064 --> 00:01:34.743
Big shooter, living fast, blazing

00:01:34.767 --> 00:01:37.346
Beat you up, cut it open, break

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:39.982
Shot shooter, he lived fast, crazy

00:01:40.006 --> 00:01:42.907
Adjust your sights at point-blank range, break

00:02:15.341 --> 00:02:19.244
"Kei, You're Awszomao!"

00:03:54.373 --> 00:03:56.000
I don't believe it.

00:04:04.717 --> 00:04:07.029
Kato...

00:04:07.053 --> 00:04:10.751
Make it stop. Make it stop...

00:04:17.563 --> 00:04:19.574
This isn't funny.

00:04:19.598 --> 00:04:21.794
This is not funny!

00:04:28.007 --> 00:04:31.671
Damn straight, most people would run away.

00:04:34.447 --> 00:04:36.279
I...

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:40.529
I understand how you feel, so...

00:04:40.553 --> 00:04:43.579
What are you talking about? Get out of there!

00:04:52.631 --> 00:05:00.539
I don't want to kill anybody.

00:05:02.975 --> 00:05:07.242
You don't understand what I'm saying. Damn!

00:05:08.414 --> 00:05:13.511
| wanted to save your buddy! I swear!

00:05:16.722 --> 00:05:18.400
What the hell is he talking about?

00:05:18.424 --> 00:05:24.005
Damn! This... This doesn't make sense.

00:05:24.029 --> 00:05:29.593
What am I doing? Shit!

00:05:30.703 --> 00:05:34.850
Kei, I think I'm gonna die.

00:05:34.874 --> 00:05:37.285
I don't want to die.

00:05:37.309 --> 00:05:40.555
Damn it! What should I do?

00:05:40.579 --> 00:05:43.959
I don't wanna die. I don't wanna die.

00:05:43.983 --> 00:05:46.428
Will this thing work?

00:05:46.452 --> 00:05:49.422
It looks different from the others.

00:05:55.995 --> 00:05:59.693
Calm down! Calm down!

00:06:12.011 --> 00:06:14.089
Kei, what's gonna happen to us?!

00:06:14.113 --> 00:06:18.026
Will we survive?! If I shoot, will we live?!

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:19.327
I don't know!

00:06:19.351 --> 00:06:21.997
I don't know, but just shoot him, Kato!

00:06:22.021 --> 00:06:23.632
What'll happen if I shoot him?!

00:06:23.656 --> 00:06:25.400
If I shoot, will we be able to go home?

00:06:25.424 --> 00:06:27.722
I said |I don't know!

00:06:28.994 --> 00:06:30.105
Are you gonna shoot?

00:06:30.129 --> 00:06:32.723
I said |I don't know!

00:06:35.534 --> 00:06:37.712
It's no use!

00:06:37.736 --> 00:06:39.614
It didn't work.

00:06:39.638 --> 00:06:42.417
What the hell are you doing? Shoot!

00:06:42.441 --> 00:06:44.119
Why don't you shoot him?!

00:06:44.143 --> 00:06:46.521
Me? Why me?

00:06:46.545 --> 00:06:48.604
Shoot him! Now!

00:06:49.748 --> 00:06:51.614
Shoot him!

00:07:03.095 --> 00:07:05.063
Kato!

00:07:11.537 --> 00:07:13.081
Kato fell!

00:07:13.105 --> 00:07:16.370
Shit... We're in deep shit now.

00:07:37.496 --> 00:07:39.828
Oh, shit! This is scary!

00:07:40.833 --> 00:07:42.858
My side aches!

00:07:44.837 --> 00:07:46.931
Grab on! Hurry!

00:07:49.208 --> 00:07:51.720
If only you'd just shot him back there...

00:07:51.744 --> 00:07:55.544
C'mon! You were so scared,
you were about ready to run too!

00:07:56.849 --> 00:07:59.716
Kato's probably dead!

00:08:00.953 --> 00:08:05.100
And that's my fault?! Why?

00:08:05.124 --> 00:08:08.436
Did I leave Kato for dead?

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:13.275
I mean, who could possibly think
about others at a time like that?

00:08:13.299 --> 00:08:15.597
That's just the way it goes!

00:08:19.238 --> 00:08:21.516
Cramps! I'm so out of shape!

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:23.736
He... He's coming!

00:08:25.611 --> 00:08:28.924
Why? Why is he chasing us?

00:08:28.948 --> 00:08:30.792
You should've shot him!

00:08:30.816 --> 00:08:32.327
I told you...

00:08:32.351 --> 00:08:33.995
Somebody!

00:08:34.019 --> 00:08:36.920
Somebody call the cops!

00:08:39.024 --> 00:08:42.585
Oh, no! Are you all right?

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:46.374
Did he get hit by that car?

00:08:46.398 --> 00:08:48.059
Is he dead?

00:08:52.371 --> 00:08:53.715
What?

00:08:53.739 --> 00:08:55.250
No one's there.

00:08:55.274 --> 00:08:57.185
Yeah.

00:08:57.209 --> 00:08:58.954
Let's get out of here.

00:08:58.978 --> 00:09:01.310
Maybe we ran over a cat or something.

00:09:02.381 --> 00:09:04.748
Hey, come on now!

00:09:07.219 --> 00:09:11.486
Can we borrow your cell phone?

00:09:12.825 --> 00:09:14.235
What's wrong?

00:09:14.259 --> 00:09:17.505
Something's here.

00:09:17.529 --> 00:09:19.641
What? What are you talking about?

00:09:19.665 --> 00:09:22.157
There's something invisible here.

00:09:32.411 --> 00:09:36.191
What's going on? Are we in Hell?

00:09:36.215 --> 00:09:38.013
My car!

00:09:40.619 --> 00:09:43.589
"Drive Safely”

00:09:46.692 --> 00:09:49.093
Sol am dead.

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:53.575
I really am dead.

00:09:53.599 --> 00:09:55.343
Man...

00:09:55.367 --> 00:09:58.962
I can never go home.

00:10:00.906 --> 00:10:02.651
Oh, well...

00:10:02.675 --> 00:10:04.386
I betno one's...

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:08.813
...sad to see me go.

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:16.498
I was always a good girl.

00:10:16.522 --> 00:10:19.567
I always tried to be a good girl.

00:10:19.591 --> 00:10:21.855
But if it's going to wind up like this...

00:10:28.167 --> 00:10:32.747
I get the feeling he'd cry for me. Why is that?

00:10:32.771 --> 00:10:35.797
Why do I think that?

00:10:42.815 --> 00:10:45.293
Kei, you're so cool.

00:10:45.317 --> 00:10:47.262
You're cooler than Goku or Kenshiro.

00:10:47.286 --> 00:10:49.482
Who? Me?

00:11:17.983 --> 00:11:23.251
One day, I'm gonna be like Kei.

00:11:24.256 --> 00:11:29.170
See, I'm not so smart, so |I go
to the school all the punks go to.

00:11:29.194 --> 00:11:32.095
So I tried to be like you.

00:12:07.266 --> 00:12:08.893
That's it!

00:12:21.246 --> 00:12:24.580
Yeah, back then...

00:12:28.954 --> 00:12:31.082
I was different.

00:12:35.494 --> 00:12:39.761
Back then, I wasn't afraid of anything.

00:12:49.374 --> 00:12:53.688
Back then, the bigger the
mess I was in, the better!

00:12:53.712 --> 00:12:55.156
Kurono!

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:58.526
I'd imagine getting myself
out of it and being a hero!

00:12:58.550 --> 00:13:01.781
It excited me!

00:13:02.821 --> 00:13:06.367
And then, I'd do it!

00:13:06.391 --> 00:13:08.382
I've still got it!

00:13:09.494 --> 00:13:12.207
I can't imagine beating this guy, but...

00:13:12.231 --> 00:13:16.464
...['ll get away from him, no matter what!

00:13:36.688 --> 00:13:40.625
He's scary... That guy's scary!

00:13:48.901 --> 00:13:50.562
-
-

00:13:58.176 --> 00:13:59.701
There he is!

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:03.673
Wait!

00:14:05.384 --> 00:14:08.012
A thousand yen for the one who gets Kurono!

00:14:14.259 --> 00:14:17.251
I wonder if he's dead?

00:14:29.207 --> 00:14:31.019
Stairs!

00:14:31.043 --> 00:14:32.420
I'll jump down them!

00:14:32.444 --> 00:14:34.469
Like I used to!

00:14:52.798 --> 00:14:55.109
Awesome!

00:14:55.133 --> 00:14:58.913
How could I jump so high?

00:14:58.937 --> 00:15:00.928
I jumped too far!

00:15:06.478 --> 00:15:09.357
This is awful. I'm so cold.

00:15:09.381 --> 00:15:13.661
No, I might make it out of this
with just two or three broken bones.

00:15:13.685 --> 00:15:17.087
Oh, wait, I'm already dead!

00:15:33.939 --> 00:15:36.384
What the hell is going on?

00:15:36.408 --> 00:15:38.433
I have absolutely no idea.

00:15:44.583 --> 00:15:46.108
Kei!

00:15:47.719 --> 00:15:49.949
Kei, run!

00:15:54.426 --> 00:15:57.157
Damn it! I'm scared!

00:16:10.542 --> 00:16:12.987
Run!

00:16:13.011 --> 00:16:15.173
Run, Kei!

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:29.517
Kei, you really are awesome.

00:17:32.491 --> 00:17:36.291
Damn it! Kato!

00:17:44.002 --> 00:17:46.699
Bring it on, fucker!

00:17:53.745 --> 00:17:56.840
Just you try to crush it!

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:07.190
Bastard!

00:18:11.062 --> 00:18:13.074
You're a fucking wuss!

00:18:13.098 --> 00:18:17.228
You jerk! Hey, bring it on!

00:18:24.142 --> 00:18:26.907
Take my green onions!

00:18:28.613 --> 00:18:31.659
What are you saying, fucker? I can't hear you!

00:18:31.683 --> 00:18:33.995
Take my green onions!

00:18:34.019 --> 00:18:37.165
Please forgive me!

00:18:37.189 --> 00:18:41.490
Why should |, you bastard?

00:18:42.861 --> 00:18:46.354
Please forgive me!

00:18:51.570 --> 00:18:53.514
Kei...

00:18:53.538 --> 00:18:55.516
Kato!

00:18:55.540 --> 00:18:59.587
You can stop now...

00:18:59.611 --> 00:19:03.624
It was... our fault... to begin...

00:19:03.648 --> 00:19:05.593
I can't hear you! What did you say?

00:19:05.617 --> 00:19:12.148
Take my green onions! Please forgive me!

00:19:14.659 --> 00:19:18.391
Take my green onions! Take my green onions!

00:19:21.733 --> 00:19:24.178
I'm sorry.

00:19:24.202 --> 00:19:26.881
What are you apologizing for? Knock it off!

00:19:26.905 --> 00:19:29.550
But think about them!

00:19:29.574 --> 00:19:31.770
Don't say you're sorry!

00:19:57.669 --> 00:19:59.194
You!

00:20:00.405 --> 00:20:03.117
Where have you been?

00:20:03.141 --> 00:20:06.202
I was close by the whole time.

00:20:09.281 --> 00:20:11.259
So we've managed to make it in time.

00:20:11.283 --> 00:20:14.562
I'll let you have the points this time.

00:20:14.586 --> 00:20:17.078
Shoot him with that gun.

00:20:33.171 --> 00:20:35.549
Shoot him with this?

00:20:35.573 --> 00:20:37.803
Yeah, with that.

00:20:39.010 --> 00:20:40.688
What'll happen if I shoot him?

00:20:40.712 --> 00:20:42.356
Just do it.

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:45.645
Pull both triggers.

00:20:52.457 --> 00:20:54.802
Hey...

00:20:54.826 --> 00:20:59.161
If I shoot him with this gun... won't he...?

00:21:01.399 --> 00:21:04.733
He'll die, of course.

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:11.940
I bet you'd love to see him die, wouldn't you?

00:21:22.821 --> 00:21:29.955
We all start out as pure and innocent babes

00:21:34.432 --> 00:21:41.463
Even if you taste the bitter fruit,
don't be discouraged, walk straight

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:54.010
I know it's in the past, but the rain still stings

00:22:00.125 --> 00:22:02.370
I'm lonely as floating ice

00:22:02.394 --> 00:22:07.208
I kiss your thin finger

00:22:07.232 --> 00:22:13.914
And remember you crying

00:22:13.938 --> 00:22:18.786
Even if this is the end

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:23.691
I won't forget your last kiss

00:22:23.715 --> 00:22:31.715
I won't forget... I won't forget...

00:22:35.627 --> 00:22:38.627
I won't forget his kiss
